    "sharp_books_note": "Known-sharper books (pinnacle, betonlineag, lowvig) are ANNOTATED (is_sharp_book, sharp_consensus_p_over) but the qualifying EV is computed against the median-of-all consensus, which is robust to a single outlier without hard-coding sharpness.",
